        "ticker": "{{question}}",
        "limit": 20
      },
      "fail_ok": true
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "analyze_absorption",
      "output_key": "analysis",
      "prompt": "Game state: {{game}}\nCurrent book: {{quote}}\nLast 30 minutes of bars: {{path}}\nRecent trades: {{tape}}\n\nAnalyze whether recent game events are fully absorbed into the price:\n\n1. List any goals/cards in the last 5 minutes from game.recent_events\n2. For each recent event, calculate minutes since it occurred\n3. Look at the candlestick pattern: is the mid still moving in one direction, or has it stabilized?\n4. Check the last 2-3 bars: is volume elevated? Is mid changing each minute or flat?\n5. Look at the tape: is there directional flow (all buys or all sells) or balanced?\n\nKey insight: Goals scored 1-3 minutes ago often take another 2-5 minutes to fully absorb. The market typically overshoots or undershoots initially, then corrects.",
      "tools": [],
      "max_tool_iterations": 0,
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "recent_events_list": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {"type": "string"},
            "description": "Goals/cards from last 5 minutes with timestamps"
          },
          "price_trend_last_5min": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Is mid rising, falling, or stable in last 5 bars?"
          },
          "volume_pattern": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Is recent volume elevated or normal? Trending up or down?"
          },
          "tape_direction": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Are recent trades one-sided (buyers/sellers) or balanced?"
          },
          "absorption_status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["still_absorbing", "fully_absorbed", "uncertain"],
            "description": "Is a recent event still being priced in?"
          },
          "momentum_cents_per_min": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "If still absorbing, estimated drift per minute based on last 3 bars"
          }
        },
        "required": ["recent_events_list", "price_trend_last_5min", "volume_pattern", "tape_direction", "absorption_status", "momentum_cents_per_min"]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "predict",
      "output_key": "prediction",
      "prompt": "Contract: {{question}}\nCurrent mid: {{quote.mid}}\nGame: {{game}}\n\nAbsorption analysis:\n- Recent events: {{analysis.recent_events_list}}\n- Price trend: {{analysis.price_trend_last_5min}}\n- Volume: {{analysis.volume_pattern}}\n- Tape: {{analysis.tape_direction}}\n- Status: {{analysis.absorption_status}}\n- Momentum: {{analysis.momentum_cents_per_min}} cents/min\n\nPredict the 5-minute price move:\n\nIf absorption_status is 'still_absorbing': project the momentum forward, but expect it to decay (maybe 3-5 more cents in same direction).\n\nIf 'fully_absorbed': consider only time decay. For a team ahead with <15 minutes left, price drifts toward 1.00 at ~0.5-1 cent per 5 minutes. For a draw late in game, favorite drifts down slightly.\n\nIf 'uncertain' or no recent events and stable book: predict 0, but use wider half-width.\n\nYour prediction is RELATIVE to current mid. Negative means price will fall. Zero means it will stay the same.\n\nQuote a half-width you'd actually trade behind on both sides. Narrow (1-2c) means high confidence, wide (4-5c) means low confidence or you wouldn't trade.",
      "tools": [],
      "max_tool_iterations": 0,
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "delta_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "How many cents the mid will MOVE over the next five minutes. Negative for down, 0 for no move. Do not state a price — state the change."
          },
          "half_width_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Half the width of the tightest two-sided market you would actually stand behind, in cents."
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "0-1. How sure, given how thin and noisy this book is."
          },
          "driver": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The one thing you expect to move it, or why nothing will."
          },
          "falsifier": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "What would show this call was wrong, before settlement."
          }
        },
        "required": ["delta_cents", "half_width_cents", "confidence", "driver", "falsifier"],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    }
  ]
}

