    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "diagnose",
      "output_key": "diagnosis",
      "prompt": "Game: {{game}}\nQuote: {{quote}}\nRecent plays: {{plays}}\nLast 18 minutes candlesticks: {{path}}\nTape: {{tape}}\nPrice velocity: {{velocity}}\nTime to settlement: {{time_left}}\nGoal timing: {{goal_timing}}\n\nDiagnose what will move the price in the next 5 minutes.\n\n1. RECENT EVENT ABSORPTION:\n   - Is there a goal/card in the last 1-4 minutes from {{plays}} or {{goal_timing}}?\n   - If yes: Look at the last 3-5 bars in {{path}}. Is mid still moving in the same direction (up if favorite scored, down if underdog scored)? Calculate cents moved so far vs. typical 10-25c total range.\n   - Estimate: if it moved 8c already and typical is 15c, maybe 4-7c more to go in same direction.\n   - If the last 2 bars are flat after a 3-bar run, absorption is complete.\n\n2. PRICE VELOCITY:\n   - {{velocity}} shows cents/minute drift over last 3, 5, 10 bars.\n   - If velocity is >0.3c/min sustained over 5+ bars, that momentum often continues 2-4 more minutes.\n   - If velocity is near zero (<0.1c/min), no momentum to project.\n\n3. TIME DECAY:\n   - From {{time_left}}: if a team is ahead with <20 minutes left, the market drifts toward 1.00 for the winner.\n   - Decay rate: ~0.3-0.8 cents per 5 minutes for a 1-goal lead with 15-25 min left. Faster as time runs out.\n   - If score is level or game just started, time decay is negligible.\n\n4. TAPE FLOW:\n   - Last 10 trades in {{tape}}: all one-sided (all taker=yes or all taker=no)?\n   - If yes and mid hasn't moved yet, that flow may push mid 1-2c in that direction.\n   - If balanced or mid already moved, flow is absorbed.\n\nOutput your assessment:",
      "tools": [],
      "max_tool_iterations": 0,
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "active_driver": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["event_absorption", "time_decay", "tape_momentum", "none"],
            "description": "Primary force that will move price in next 5min"
          },
          "event_absorption_remaining_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "If absorbing a goal/card, estimated cents still to move (0 if done or no event)"
          },
          "time_decay_cents_per_5min": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Expected drift from clock running down (negative if favorite fading, positive if favorite winning)"
          },
          "tape_momentum_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Expected move from one-sided tape flow not yet priced (0 if balanced)"
          },
          "price_velocity_3bar": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Cents per minute over last 3 bars from velocity tool"
          },
          "confidence_level": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["high", "medium", "low"],
            "description": "How clear the signal is"
          }
        },
        "required": ["active_driver", "event_absorption_remaining_cents", "time_decay_cents_per_5min", "tape_momentum_cents", "price_velocity_3bar", "confidence_level"]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "prompt",
      "name": "predict",
      "output_key": "prediction",
      "prompt": "Ticker: {{question}}\nCurrent mid: {{quote.mid}}\n\nDiagnosis:\n- Active driver: {{diagnosis.active_driver}}\n- Event absorption remaining: {{diagnosis.event_absorption_remaining_cents}}c\n- Time decay: {{diagnosis.time_decay_cents_per_5min}}c per 5min\n- Tape momentum: {{diagnosis.tape_momentum_cents}}c\n- Price velocity (3-bar): {{diagnosis.price_velocity_3bar}}c/min\n- Confidence: {{diagnosis.confidence_level}}\n\nForecast the 5-minute move:\n\n1. Sum the components:\n   - If active_driver is \"event_absorption\": main component is event_absorption_remaining_cents, but decay over 5 minutes (assume half remains after 5min)\n   - If active_driver is \"time_decay\": main component is time_decay_cents_per_5min\n   - If active_driver is \"tape_momentum\": main component is tape_momentum_cents\n   - If active_driver is \"none\": delta should be near 0, but still add any small time_decay\n\n2. If price_velocity_3bar is strong (>0.4c/min) and pointing same direction as your forecast, increase magnitude by 1-2c. If opposite, reduce magnitude.\n\n3. Half-width:\n   - High confidence + clear driver: 1.5-2c\n   - Medium confidence: 2.5-3c\n   - Low confidence or \"none\" driver: 3-4c\n   - Very thin book (spread >2c): add 1c to half-width\n\n4. Delta_cents is the CHANGE from current mid, not a price level. Negative means down.\n\n5. Be willing to forecast small non-zero moves (0.3-1.5c) when there's real time decay or residual momentum, not just \"0\" because nothing dramatic is happening.\n\nReturn your forecast:",
      "tools": [],
      "max_tool_iterations": 0,
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "delta_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Cents the mid will MOVE over next 5 minutes. Negative for down, 0 for flat."
          },
          "half_width_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Half-width of two-sided market you'd stand behind, in cents."
